Schema changes belong in `apps/database/supabase/schemas/*.sql` only.

Never hand-edit files in `apps/database/supabase/migrations`. Generate with `supabase db diff`.

Never create, stage, or commit `.oneignore`.

Skills live in `.agents/skills/`. Do not copy them into `.cursor/skills`.
